{"id":"d55ca90b9e3ac1b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-infinity.md","title":"Infinity","display":"thm-infinity — Infinity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-infinity","aliases":["58-thm-infinity"],"display":"thm-infinity — Infinity","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-infinity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-infinity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-infinity — Infinity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f6d414affafe82d\" href=\"?note=2f6d414affafe82d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md\">../batch03/58-df-inductive.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the inductive-set predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f6d414affafe82d\" href=\"?note=2f6d414affafe82d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md\">../batch03/58-df-inductive.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> is the least inductive set defined there.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}infinity}\\vdash\n\\exists w\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ind}(w)\\land\n\\forall X\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ind}(X)\\to w\\subseteq X)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}infinity}\\vdash\n\\exists w\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ind}(w)\\land\n\\forall X\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ind}(X)\\to w\\subseteq X)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\omega\">\\(w=\\omega\\)</span> from the upstream least-inductive-set construction.</li>\n<li>Infinity guarantees an inductive set exists; the displayed theorem isolates its least member under inclusion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2f6d414affafe82d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2f6d414affafe82d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the inductive-set predicate from [[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}infinity}\\vdash\n\\exists w\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ind}(w)\\land\n\\forall X\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Ind}(X)\\to w\\subseteq X)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"w=\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":788,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-infinity.md|58-thm-infinity]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["2f6d414affafe82d"]}